 *
 * Partition layout — the Thingy:91 board DTS already defines its own
 *   complete flash + SRAM partitions (thingy91_nrf9160_partition.dtsi
 *   + nrf91_partition_sram.dtsi). No partition overlay entries needed here;
 *   adding nrf91_bootloader_partitions.dtsi would cause a DTS conflict because
 *   the board uses its own immutable bootloader partition scheme.
 *
 * LED GPIO — inherited from thingy91_nrf9160_common.dtsi:
 *   led0 alias → red_led → gpio0 pin 29, active-high
 *   No LED overlay entry needed.
 *
 * PMIC — Thingy:91 uses an ADP5360 PMIC (not nPM1300). Battery metrics
 *   are disabled for this board via thingy91_nrf9160_ns.conf.
 */
